// Playlist A playlist: a manual ordered list (`static`) or a rule evaluated per user on read (`smart`). `rule` is present only for smart playlists. `itemCount` is always the caller's own view of the membership: present and live for a static playlist, computed on detail reads and omitted from list pages for a smart one.
